# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test

# Scratch dirs the browser-driving tools write into while verifying a change — screenshots, console
# logs, page snapshots. Regenerated on demand; safe to delete at any time.
/.playwright-cli
/.playwright-mcp

# Moved to its own repo: github.com/BikeNetKit/docs-map-demo. Ignored so a stale local copy
# (or a still-running Jupyter session) doesn't show up as untracked noise — safe to delete.
/docs-map-demo

# The private working-docs repo: the project brief, launch plan, todo list, the data-export
# documents and the plan files. It has its own .git and its own remote
# (MoritzStefaner/bikenetkit-internal, private) — nothing in it may ever be committed here.
# Nested inside this checkout rather than beside it so its repo-relative links into www/ keep
# resolving and both open in one editor window.
/internal

# Maintainer-only agent instructions (imports internal/AGENTS-internal.md). Gitignored on
# purpose, which means it exists only in the checkout that created it — copy it into each new
# worktree. See internal/AGENTS-internal.md § New worktree setup.
/CLAUDE.local.md

# Handover draft of the metrics FAQ for faq.bikenetkit.org, whose source of truth is the FAQ
# repo (BikeNetKit/.github) once pasted there. Kept out of the tree so it cannot drift as a
# second copy of that page; the in-app version lives in www/src/lib/data/metric-help.ts.
/METRICS.md
plan-*.md
/tmp
